187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Modern agriculture faces major challenges due to crop damage caused by insects and pests, leading to reduced productivity and financial losses for farmers. Traditional pest identification methods mainly depend on manual inspection and expert consultation, which are often time-consuming, expensive, and inaccessible in rural areas. Incorrect pest identification frequently results in excessive pesticide usage, negatively affecting soil fertility, water quality, and environmental sustainability.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (The AI-Powered Insect Detection and Pesticide Recommendation System was developed as a smart farming solution to address these challenges through artificial intelligence and computer vision technologies. The system focuses on providing real-time insect detection, accurate pest classification, and intelligent pesticide recommendations using uploaded crop images.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Unlike conventional methods, the proposed system automates pest identification using deep learning models, particularly Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNN\), enabling faster and more reliable decision-making for farmers. The platform aims to reduce unnecessary pesticide usage while improving crop protection and agricultural productivity.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (The application allows farmers to upload crop images through a mobile or web interface, after which the AI model analyzes the image and displays the detected pest along with suitable pesticide recommendations and preventive measures.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
