193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The methodology of the proposed system begins with collecting and preprocessing insect image datasets from agricultural sources. The images are resized, normalized, and enhanced to improve model accuracy. A Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\) model is then trained using the processed dataset to identify and classify crop pests. Farmers can upload crop images through a mobile or web application, where the trained AI model performs real-time pest detection and classification. Based on the detected insect and infestation level, the system provides suitable pesticide recommendations and preventive measures to support effective and sustainable pest management.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
