/P 93 0 R
/E (Additional improvements may include multilingual support, voice assistance for farmers, and integration with weather forecasting systems to predict pest outbreaks in advance. The project can further evolve into a complete AI-based smart farming platform using cloud computing, mobile technologies, and real-time agricultural analytics.)
